p.src:
Parameterize an open string by $0\leq\sigma\leq\pi.$ The label $\sigma$ is not a spacetime position. The embedding $X^\mu(\sigma,\tau)$ tells us where that labeled point lies in spacetime, while $\tau$ measures evolution. A point particle sweeps out a worldline; the moving string sweeps out a two-dimensional worldsheet. In the free theory each embedding coordinate obeys $\frac{\partial^2X^\mu}{\partial\tau^2}
  -
  \frac{\partial^2X^\mu}{\partial\sigma^2}
  =0.$

